{"id":"msg_m_ex_oldtales_01","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_oldtales","label":"Old Tales · Group"},"label":"1. Prince! Grave!","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"msg_m_ex_oldtales_02","speakers":{"cinderella":"Cinderella","grave":"Grave"},"icons":{"cinderella":"si_c511_00_s","grave":"si_c514_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_1","text":"Prince! Grave!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_2","text":"We've got a big problem.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_3","text":"Cinderella.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_4","text":"What's wrong?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_5","text":"The ends of my hair got tangled.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_6","text":"What?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_7","text":"Was it something I did?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_8","text":"Did I get them tangled up somehow?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_9","text":"No.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_10","text":"Prince was very thorough in his brushing yesterday,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_11","text":"but perhaps he could have been more beautiful in applying the finishing touches.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_12","text":"Superhuman,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_13","text":"Cinderella's hair is very delicate.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_14","text":"You can't simply brush it with the bare minimum amount of care necessary.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_15","text":"Because it's so long and silky,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_16","text":"you have to brush it attentively the entire time,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_17","text":"from the very beginning to the very end.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_18","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_18","text":"I'm sorry...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_19","text":"Sorry won't cut it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_20","text":"Once Cinderella's hair gets tangled,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_21","text":"do you realize what an ordeal it is to untangle it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_22","text":"Sorting out all the twisted bits without damaging her hair","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_23","text":"takes far more time and effort than brushing it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_24","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_24","text":"I said I was sorry...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_25","text":"Grave, that's enough.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_26","text":"It's far from beautiful to become as incensed as you are.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_27","text":"I'm perfectly fine.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_28","text":"All right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_29","text":"Sorry, I got a little worked up.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_30","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_30","text":"That's very kind of you, Cinderella.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_31","text":"Now then.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_32","text":"Since we all would like to avoid this in the future,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_33","text":"Grave, why don't you teach Prince how to brush my hair?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_34","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_34","text":"What?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_35","text":"Grave brushes my hair perfectly.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_36","text":"The speed, pressure, the general feel. Everything.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_37","text":"All right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_38","text":"Where are you, Superhuman?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_39","text":"I'll go over the finer points of hair brushing with you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_40","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_40","text":"The finer points? Is it really that complicated?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_41","text":"Hey!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_42","text":"I don't like your attitude.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_43","text":"This is an important matter. One worthy of dedicating an entire class to.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_44","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_44","text":"Sorry...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_45","text":"I'll prepare some different combs.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_46","text":"Come by whenever you have time.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_01_47","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_01_47","text":"All right.","jump":null}],"chat":true}